Signals: "ทำไมไม่ทำตาม" · "you skipped" · "didn't log" · "ลืม" + a harness step name — OR a WHOLE-harness complaint (the harness AS A WHOLE is the target, no specific step named), with or without a "ทำไม/why" prefix — e.g. "ทำไมไม่ทำตาม harness" · "ทำไมไม่ทำงานตาม harness" · "ไม่ทำตาม harness" · "not following the harness" (illustrative, NOT an exhaustive whitelist — match the intent, not the literal string) → emit `[self-improve] Rule: <R-N> · Missed: <what>` → execute missed step → emit `[✓ backfilled]`. (Still EXCLUDE a feature request — "ลืมบอกให้เพิ่ม X" is not a compliance complaint → pass to C1.)
→ **MANDATORY same-response tool call:** Edit `CODING_FAILURE_PATTERNS.md` — `## CFP-<N+1>`: Symptom/Root/Prevention/Detection/topic:<id>/count:0/recurrences:[]
→ After Edit: `grep -c "^## CFP-" CODING_FAILURE_PATTERNS.md` → count = N+1 · emit `[✓ CFP-<N+1>]`

